WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.589
"Okay, Rocket Girl." Detective Smith put his phone back in his pocket.

2
00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:23.340
"We have to—Rocket Girl?"

3
00:00:23.341 --> 00:00:26.961
Roxy saw a young woman run out of Metro City Shopping Mall.

4
00:00:26.962 --> 00:00:32.109
The woman carried a violin case and a large sack.

5
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:35.301
"That must be Violet Sharp!" Roxy thought.

6
00:00:35.302 --> 00:00:41.053
Roxy landed in the street. "Stop right there, Violet!"

7
00:00:41.054 --> 00:00:45.788
Violet glared at Roxy. "What do you want, Rocket Girl?"

8
00:00:45.789 --> 00:00:50.032
"Are you stealing stuff from people?" Roxy asked.

9
00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:53.384
Violet didn't reply.

10
00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:56.419
"You're a talented musician," Roxy said.

11
00:00:56.420 --> 00:01:01.125
"I heard the Metro City Symphony Orchestra invited you to try out.

12
00:01:01.126 --> 00:01:04.291
Why are you stealing?"

13
00:01:04.292 --> 00:01:06.505
"Hmph!" Violet scowled.

14
00:01:06.506 --> 00:01:10.773
"They said I wasn't good enough to be in their silly orchestra.

15
00:01:10.774 --> 00:01:15.200
I'll show them. I made a violin that hypnotizes people.

16
00:01:15.201 --> 00:01:19.718
Now I'll be richer than any musician in history!"

17
00:01:19.719 --> 00:01:23.335
She jumped into a waiting bus.

18
00:01:23.336 --> 00:01:26.093
The bus drove off.

19
00:01:26.094 --> 00:01:28.672
Roxy shot after it.

20
00:01:28.673 --> 00:01:31.301
Violet glared at Roxy through the window.

21
00:01:31.302 --> 00:01:36.440
"You can't stop me!" she shouted.

22
00:01:36.441 --> 00:01:38.959
She pulled out her violin.

23
00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:42.779
As she played, the other passengers stared at her.

24
00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:47.575
Their eyes looked blank.

25
00:01:47.576 --> 00:01:51.626
Violet jumped off the bus and ran around a corner.

26
00:01:51.627 --> 00:01:54.124
Roxy was about to chase her.

27
00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:57.563
But the bus was driving out of control!

28
00:01:57.564 --> 00:01:59.677
Cars drove onto the sidewalk.

29
00:01:59.678 --> 00:02:02.484
People ran and dived behind garbage cans.

30
00:02:02.485 --> 00:02:07.351
One man shook his fist. "Crazy bus driver!"

31
00:02:07.352 --> 00:02:09.735
"Oh no!" Roxy cried.

32
00:02:09.736 --> 00:02:14.120
"Violet hypnotized the bus driver!"

33
00:02:14.121 --> 00:02:20.790
She shot after the bus and pulled it to a stop.

34
00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:26.097
The driver woke up and blinked. "What happened?"

35
00:02:26.098 --> 00:02:28.594
Roxy didn't have time to answer.

36
00:02:28.595 --> 00:02:35.828
"I must stop Violet!" She flew around the corner.

37
00:02:35.829 --> 00:02:39.302
Violet was running past a construction site.

38
00:02:39.303 --> 00:02:42.336
Workers were building a skyscraper.

39
00:02:42.337 --> 00:02:46.665
Men and women walked along metal beams high above.

40
00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:50.444
"Violet!" Roxy shouted. "Stop!"

41
00:02:50.445 --> 00:02:53.627
Violet spun around with an evil grin.

42
00:02:53.628 --> 00:02:57.192
She played a few notes.

43
00:02:57.193 --> 00:03:00.898
Roxy was too far away to hear clearly.

44
00:03:00.899 --> 00:03:04.475
But everyone near Violet stood still.

45
00:03:04.476 --> 00:03:08.269
Workers above dropped their tools.

46
00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:11.348
Roxy flew fast.

47
00:03:11.349 --> 00:03:16.325
She grabbed the hypnotized people and moved them to safety.

48
00:03:16.326 --> 00:03:23.291
Tools slammed down onto the sidewalk.

49
00:03:23.292 --> 00:03:27.320
"Rocket Girl, watch out!" a woman shouted.

50
00:03:27.321 --> 00:03:31.629
Roxy looked up and saw a huge steel beam falling.

51
00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:34.580
She reached up and caught it.

52
00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:36.817
"Whew!" she said.

53
00:03:36.818 --> 00:03:40.116
Then she heard strange music next to her ear.

54
00:03:40.117 --> 00:03:43.094
Violet was playing her violin!

55
00:03:43.095 --> 00:03:47.101
Before Roxy could react, everything became blurry.

56
00:03:47.102 --> 00:03:53.679
"Oh no," Roxy murmured. "I'm . . . becoming . . ."

57
00:03:53.680 --> 00:04:02.107
Violet let out an evil laugh. "Hypnotized!"
